          "message": {
            "text": "Square mixed dashed/dotted sides preserve Blink’s full side path and delegate corner ownership to the miter clip. The thick-dot endpoint inset is applied only after dash fitting, and the phase is translated by the same inset; this mirrors pinned Chromium 7d859f271c BoxBorderPainter / DrawLineWithStyle instead of fitting offsets to screenshots. The focused matrix in src/render/mixed-dashed-dotted-border.test.ts proves adjacent-width, missing-side, orientation, thick-dot, thin-dot, and retired-shortening behavior.",
            "markdown": "Square mixed dashed/dotted sides preserve Blink’s full side path and delegate corner ownership to the miter clip. The thick-dot endpoint inset is applied only after dash fitting, and the phase is translated by the same inset; this mirrors pinned Chromium 7d859f271c BoxBorderPainter / DrawLineWithStyle instead of fitting offsets to screenshots. The focused matrix in src/render/mixed-dashed-dotted-border.test.ts proves adjacent-width, missing-side, orientation, thick-dot, thin-dot, and retired-shortening behavior."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
