          "message": {
            "text": "Blink applies the bottom background layer's color and URL image through the same alpha glyph mask, so wrapped text clips must use the captured stitched positioning area rather than repainting color on the box or restarting URL phase per line. The live DPR1/2 oracle is source-exact within the fixed four-device-pixel edge gate without rasterizing text.",
            "markdown": "Blink applies the bottom background layer's color and URL image through the same alpha glyph mask, so wrapped text clips must use the captured stitched positioning area rather than repainting color on the box or restarting URL phase per line. The live DPR1/2 oracle is source-exact within the fixed four-device-pixel edge gate without rasterizing text."
          },
