            "text": "Localized reference filters must be inside the blend Effect wrapper. Pinned Blink builds the general Effect/blend node before the Filter node; reversing those groups isolates SourceGraphic and makes mix-blend-mode miss its backdrop. The DPR1/2 oracle is source-exact across all filter/blend/isolation rows with unchanged four-code and eight-code bounds.",
